    "summary": "This PR trims the GET /admin/audit list endpoint so it returns only lightweight summary rows (request/response headers and bodies are replaced with empty placeholders), adds `total`/`has_more` pagination metadata, and caps the requested page size at 500. The React audit table now lazy-fetches full entries via GET /admin/audit/{id} when a row is expanded and renders from `entryDetails[detailKey] ?? entry`. Reviewers should focus on list/detail field parity in `pg_audit_reader.go` and on the expanded-row rendering in `AuditTrail.tsx`, where the payload-less summary row is used as a fallback source of headers/bodies.",
